            },
            "note": {
              "J100": [
                "As of 2013 the indicator on looking after younger siblings is based on the question  Do you sometimes look after younger brothers or sisters?  In previous years the questions was  Take care of your brothers or sisters? . (The introduction to the block of questions has not changed:  Which of the following do you usually do at home at least once a week? .)"
              ],
              "J110": [
                "As of 2013 the indicator is based on buying food in the question  Do you usually buy food yourself?  In previous years the question was  Buy food? . (The introduction to the block of questions has not changed:  Which of the following do you usually do at home at least once a week? .)"
              ],
              "J120": [
                "As of 2013 the indicator is based on working outdoors in the question  Do you help with outdoor work?  In previous years the question was  Work outdoors? . (The introduction to the block of questions has not changed:  Which of the following do you usually do at home at least once a week? .)"
              ]
            }
